# Public routes (player prototype)

- Canonical paths: [contracts/public-routes.md](../../contracts/public-routes.md)
- Player URL: `/video-reviews/{categorySlug}/{brandSlug}/{productSlug}/{reviewId}` — no `/reviewers/` routes
- Routes: `PageCanvas` → `components/screens/public/*Screen` only; no layout or feature UI in `app/(public)/**`
- Platform (`/company`, `/reviewer`, `/bdn`): `app/(platform)/` — see `platform-routes.mdc`
- Video UI (product, not DS): `components/ui/composites/video-reviews/`, `components/ui/molecules/video-reviews/`
- Data: `lib/fixtures/` for reviews/brands; categories via `lib/data/interest-categories-dev.ts` → `lib/data/interest-categories.csv` (sync from gitignored `data/` export when updating)
- Also follow [layout-shell-page-canvas.md](../../contracts/layout-shell-page-canvas.md), [prototyping-approach.md](../../contracts/prototyping-approach.md)
